        "original_id": "4107f9de-d562-55f2-aa88-0445c85696f5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Bizarre, Fortean Times\n- Companies: Dennis Publishing, John Brown Publishing, I Feel Good Publishing\n- People: Charles Fort, Bob Basset\n- Topics: anomalous phenomena\n\nFacts:\n- Bizarre was a British alternative magazine published from 1997 to 2015.\n- Fortean Times is a British monthly magazine devoted to anomalous phenomena popularised by Charles Fort.\n- Fortean Times was published by John Brown Publishing from 1991 to 2001.\n- Fortean Times was published by I Feel Good Publishing from 2001 to 2005.\n- Bizarre was published by Dennis Publishing and was a sister publication to Fortean Times.\n- Fortean Times is now published by Dennis Publishing Ltd.\n- Publications about Bob Basset appeared in WAD magazine, VICE UK, Bizarre Magazine, and INSIDE artzine magazine.",
